[
  {"comment": "Thin walls along sketch curves (mitcad#463): an L of lines (0,0)-(40,0)-(40,30) bending left (Sketch1 F1), a wall 2 thick on side 1 (its right: round the outside of the corner, mitred) 10 high (Extrude1 F2): 2 * 40 + 2 * 30 + 2 * 2 = 144 mm2."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F1", "start": [0, 0], "end": [40, 0]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F1", "start": [40, 0], "end": [40, 30]},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10},
    "thin": {"location": "side1", "thickness": 2, "curves": {"sketch": "F1", "curves": ["c1", "c4"]}},
    "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude1", "status": "ok", "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 1440, "faces": 8,
    "min": [0, -2, 0], "max": [42, 30, 10], "has_face": "F2:outer(c1)"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "has_face": "F2:tip0(c1)"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "has_face": "F2:tip1(c4)"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "has_face": "F2:start(r{c1,c4})"}},
  {"comment": "Inside the corner (side 2): 144 - 2 * 4; centred, symmetric 5 each way: 140."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F2", "def": {"type": "extrude", "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10},
    "thin": {"location": "side2", "thickness": 2, "curves": {"sketch": "F1", "curves": ["c4", "c1"]}},
    "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude1", "status": "ok", "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 1360, "min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [40, 30, 10]}},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F2", "def": {"type": "extrude", "extent": {"type": "symmetric", "distance": 5},
    "thin": {"location": "center", "thickness": 2, "curves": {"sketch": "F1", "curves": ["c1", "c4"]}},
    "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude1", "status": "ok", "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 1400, "min": [0, -1, -5], "max": [41, 30, 5]}},

  {"comment": "A half circle of radius 10 about (100, 0), counter-clockwise (Sketch2 F3), a wall 2 thick centred on it (Extrude2 F4): a half ring 9 to 11, pi / 2 * 40 * 10."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.arc", "sketch": "F3", "mode": "center", "center": [100, 0], "start": [110, 0], "end": [90, 0]},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10},
    "thin": {"location": "center", "thickness": 2, "curves": {"sketch": "F3", "curves": ["c1"], "chain": true}},
    "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude2", "status": "ok", "body": "F4.b0", "volume": 628.3185307179587, "tolerance": 1e-6}},

  {"comment": "The lines of a 40 x 20 rectangle at (200, 0) as curves (Sketch3 F5), a wall on side 1, outside the area they enclose (Extrude3 F6): (44 * 24 - 40 * 20) * 10; then inside (side 2), (40 * 20 - 36 * 16) * 10, joined to a block of the same rectangle 5 deep under it (Extrude4 F7): 2240 + 4000."},
